5374	{"artifactId":"LLD-edb76e2e4d41217d-s7","entry":{"id":"migrated-LLD-edb76e2e4d41217d-s7-review","actor":{"id":"insrc:controller","kind":"agent","properties":{}},"timestamp":"2026-09-26T07:06:56.345Z","operation":"review","outcome":{"result":"pass","summary":"review: pass","data":{"kind":"review","report":{"artifact":"design.story","stage":"design.story","verdict":"pass","findings":[{"claimId":"cl1","ref":"daemon-ipc/inventory","kind":"inventory","severity":"LOW","premise":"The daemon registers exactly the four review IPCs S007 consumes — workflow.pending, workflow.artifactContent, workflow.resolveComment, workflow.approve — and there is NO workflow.reject handler.","evidence":"src/daemon/index.ts registers workflow.approve (:610), workflow.pending (:634), workflow.artifactContent (:646), workflow.resolveComment (:660) and workflow.run.start/poll/abort/run — there is NO workflow.reject handler (a direct grep of index.ts over the workflow.* keys returns exactly these). The 'no reject IPC -> reject = resolveComment + stay-pending' premise is sound.","action":"none — verified sound","fixability":"auto"},{"claimId":"cl2","ref":"daemon-ipc/pending","kind":"citation","severity":"LOW","premise":"workflow.pending is registered in src/daemon/index.ts and delegates to handleWorkflowPending.","evidence":"src/daemon/index.ts:634 registers 'workflow.pending' and delegates to handleWorkflowPending (import from ../workflow/pending.js), confirmed by direct read this session.","action":"none — verified sound","fixability":"auto"},{"claimId":"cl3","ref":"data-model/PendingArtifact","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"The daemon PendingArtifact carries artifactId, kind, title, mdPath, openQuestionCount, state — the fields S007 maps to DocsArtifactSummary and uses for open-doc/approve (mdPath).","evidence":"src/workflow/pending.ts declares interface PendingArtifact with artifactId/kind/title/mdPath/openQuestionCount/state (read this session); the JetBrains DaemonGateway.k